  "entry": "code/app.py",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). A scholar loads a source text, marks mentions of persons, places, works, organizations, events and terms that become linkable entities, merges coreferent entities, annotates mentions, fills in bibliographic metadata and exports the edition as TEI P5 XML. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
